{
    "title": "Photo Collage Maker,Pic Editor",
    "description": "<b>Collage Maker - Photo Editor is an all-in-one and professional photo collage maker and picture editing app.</b> It allows you to make cool photo grid & collage effects with 1000+ picture collage layouts, frames, backgrounds, templates, stickers & text fonts. Then you can directly post your no watermark artwork in high resolution to Instagram, Snapchat, WhatsApp, Facebook, TikTok, etc. \ud83d\udcab\ud83d\udc96\r\n\r\n<b>Collage Maker - Photo Editor offers everything you want to enhance photo.</b> It enables you to remove background, create photo collage, make stickers, and add stylish effects & filters in one tap. Collage Maker - Photo Editor will be your perfect life companion for making collages and editing photos! \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf8a\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 <b>Professional Collage Maker & Photo Grid</b>\r\n* Combine up to 18 photos to create fun layouts and pic collages\r\n* 200+ unique photo effects for making unique photo collages\r\n* 1000+ grids, backgrounds, frames, fonts & filters to choose from\r\n* Customize ratio of collage and edit border of collage\r\n* Make photo collage with Free style or Grid style\r\n* Save photos in high resolution and share pictures on social media\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 <b>Creative Photo Collage Templates & Photo Posters</b>\r\n* 700+ templates, including the theme of Festivals, Regions, Crowds, Seasons\u2026\r\n* Easily to swap, change and rotate and zoom pictures in the templates\r\n* Flexibly create photo collages and make a shaped collage such as heart or diamond\r\n* 100% editable: change the default text and create the right atmosphere with filters\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Powerful Photo Editor</b>\r\n* Crop, rotate, resize, mirror, blur, cutout, flip images, pinch to zoom in or out\r\n* Adjust brightness, contrast, highlights, warmth, shadows, sharpness, exposure etc.\r\n* Large number of stickers, emojis, text, graffiti, borders for every need\r\n* AI Background Eraser change photo background with one tap in seconds\r\n* Turn your pics into art with perfect filters, effects and photo editing tools\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7b <b>More Features for Collage Maker - Photo Editor</b>\r\n\u2606 Freestyle: the blank canvas option to give total freedom to create at your own pace\r\n\u2606 Pic-Sew: Combine more than 9 photos into a long story picture\r\n\u2606 Multi-fit: choose multiple ratios: 1:1, 3:4, 4:5, 9:16, etc. Easily post entire photo with no crop\r\n\u2606 Cutout photos by tracing shapes with your finger\r\n\u2606 Choose & change any color, opacity, beautiful background and patterns\r\n\u2606 Built-in 100+ Layouts of frames or grids to choose from\r\n\u2606 60+ awesome photo filters and 130+ wonderful stickers\r\n\u2606 Choose the border width and rounded corner size\r\n\u2606 Add text on photo with 100+ art typefaces\r\n\u2606 30+ style mosaics, cover anything that you want to hide\r\n\u2606 Crop photos freely\r\n\u2606 Choose multiple ratios, 1:1, 4:5, 3:2 ratios, etc\r\n\r\nCollage Maker - Photo Editor can satisfy all your imagination about images. Download it now, and tell your own story through photos without creating an account or registering! \ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc51",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Collage Maker - Photo Editor is an all-in-one and professional photo collage maker and picture editing app.</b> It allows you to make cool photo grid &amp; collage effects with 1000+ picture collage layouts, frames, backgrounds, templates, stickers &amp; text fonts. Then you can directly post your no watermark artwork in high resolution to Instagram, Snapchat, WhatsApp, Facebook, TikTok, etc. \ud83d\udcab\ud83d\udc96<br><br><b>Collage Maker - Photo Editor offers everything you want to enhance photo.</b> It enables you to remove background, create photo collage, make stickers, and add stylish effects &amp; filters in one tap. Collage Maker - Photo Editor will be your perfect life companion for making collages and editing photos! \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf8a<br><br>\ud83d\udcf8 <b>Professional Collage Maker &amp; Photo Grid</b><br>* Combine up to 18 photos to create fun layouts and pic collages<br>* 200+ unique photo effects for making unique photo collages<br>* 1000+ grids, backgrounds, frames, fonts &amp; filters to choose from<br>* Customize ratio of collage and edit border of collage<br>* Make photo collage with Free style or Grid style<br>* Save photos in high resolution and share pictures on social media<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 <b>Creative Photo Collage Templates &amp; Photo Posters</b><br>* 700+ templates, including the theme of Festivals, Regions, Crowds, Seasons\u2026<br>* Easily to swap, change and rotate and zoom pictures in the templates<br>* Flexibly create photo collages and make a shaped collage such as heart or diamond<br>* 100% editable: change the default text and create the right atmosphere with filters<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Powerful Photo Editor</b><br>* Crop, rotate, resize, mirror, blur, cutout, flip images, pinch to zoom in or out<br>* Adjust brightness, contrast, highlights, warmth, shadows, sharpness, exposure etc.<br>* Large number of stickers, emojis, text, graffiti, borders for every need<br>* AI Background Eraser change photo background with one tap in seconds<br>* Turn your pics into art with perfect filters, effects and photo editing tools<br><br>\ud83c\udf7b <b>More Features for Collage Maker - Photo Editor</b><br>\u2606 Freestyle: the blank canvas option to give total freedom to create at your own pace<br>\u2606 Pic-Sew: Combine more than 9 photos into a long story picture<br>\u2606 Multi-fit: choose multiple ratios: 1:1, 3:4, 4:5, 9:16, etc. Easily post entire photo with no crop<br>\u2606 Cutout photos by tracing shapes with your finger<br>\u2606 Choose &amp; change any color, opacity, beautiful background and patterns<br>\u2606 Built-in 100+ Layouts of frames or grids to choose from<br>\u2606 60+ awesome photo filters and 130+ wonderful stickers<br>\u2606 Choose the border width and rounded corner size<br>\u2606 Add text on photo with 100+ art typefaces<br>\u2606 30+ style mosaics, cover anything that you want to hide<br>\u2606 Crop photos freely<br>\u2606 Choose multiple ratios, 1:1, 4:5, 3:2 ratios, etc<br><br>Collage Maker - Photo Editor can satisfy all your imagination about images. Download it now, and tell your own story through photos without creating an account or registering! \ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc51",
